{
  "title": "OSF Edge Home",
  "uid": "osf-home",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "10s",
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "tags": ["osf", "home", "demo"],
  "time": { "from": "now-2h", "to": "now" },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Workpiece Trace",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/osf-workpiece-trace/workpiece-trace",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "targetBlank": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Orders",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/osf-orders/orders",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "targetBlank": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Sensors",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/osf-sensor-snapshots/sensor-snapshots",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "targetBlank": false
    },
    {
      "title": "FTS / AGV",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/osf-fts/fts-agv",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "targetBlank": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Systemstatus",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/osf-system-status/systemstatus",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Events (last minute)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "mssql", "uid": "POSFMSQL001" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "format": "time_series",
          "refId": "A",
          "rawSql": "SELECT DATETRUNC(minute, ts) AS time, CAST(COUNT(*) AS FLOAT) AS value FROM shopfloor_event WHERE ts >= DATEADD(minute, -15, SYSUTCDATETIME()) GROUP BY DATETRUNC(minute, ts) ORDER BY 1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Orders (24h)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "mssql", "uid": "POSFMSQL001" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "blue", "value": null }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A",
          "rawSql": "SELECT CAST(COUNT(*) AS FLOAT) AS orders_24h FROM shopfloor_order WHERE received_at >= DATEADD(hour, -24, SYSUTCDATETIME())"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "NFCs in window",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "mssql", "uid": "POSFMSQL001" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "purple", "value": null }]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A",
          "rawSql": "SELECT CAST(COUNT(DISTINCT workpiece_id) AS FLOAT) AS nfcs FROM shopfloor_event WHERE workpiece_id IS NOT NULL AND $__timeFilter(ts)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "FTS battery %",
      "type": "gauge",
      "datasource": { "type": "mssql", "uid": "POSFMSQL001" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 30 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 50 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A",
          "rawSql": "SELECT TOP 1 CAST(JSON_VALUE(payload_json, '$.batteryState.percentage') AS FLOAT) AS battery_pct FROM shopfloor_event WHERE topic LIKE N'fts/%/state' AND JSON_VALUE(payload_json, '$.batteryState.percentage') IS NOT NULL ORDER BY ts DESC"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Orders by State × Color (24h)",
      "type": "barchart",
      "datasource": { "type": "mssql", "uid": "POSFMSQL001" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 80, "gradientMode": "none", "lineWidth": 1 }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "BLUE" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "#1E88E5", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "WHITE" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "#E0E0E0", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "RED" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "#E53935", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "UNKNOWN" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "#9E9E9E", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "stacking": "normal",
        "orientation": "vertical",
        "xTickLabelRotation": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A",
          "rawSql": "SELECT ISNULL(state, N'?') AS state, CAST(SUM(CASE WHEN workpiece_type = N'BLUE' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS FLOAT) AS BLUE, CAST(SUM(CASE WHEN workpiece_type = N'WHITE' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS FLOAT) AS WHITE, CAST(SUM(CASE WHEN workpiece_type = N'RED' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS FLOAT) AS RED, CAST(SUM(CASE WHEN workpiece_type IS NULL OR workpiece_type NOT IN (N'BLUE', N'WHITE', N'RED') THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS FLOAT) AS UNKNOWN FROM shopfloor_order WHERE received_at >= DATEADD(hour, -24, SYSUTCDATETIME()) GROUP BY state ORDER BY state"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Recent workpieces",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": { "type": "mssql", "uid": "POSFMSQL001" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 11 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A",
          "rawSql": "SELECT TOP 15 workpiece_id AS nfc, type AS color, current_state AS state, last_location AS location, last_seen_at FROM workpiece ORDER BY last_seen_at DESC"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "FTS snapshot",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": { "type": "mssql", "uid": "POSFMSQL001" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 11 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A",
          "rawSql": "SELECT module_serial AS serial, ts, JSON_VALUE(payload_json, '$.lastNodeId') AS last_node, JSON_VALUE(payload_json, '$.driving') AS driving, JSON_VALUE(payload_json, '$.paused') AS paused, JSON_VALUE(payload_json, '$.batteryState.percentage') AS battery_pct, JSON_VALUE(payload_json, '$.batteryState.charging') AS charging FROM (SELECT module_serial, ts, payload_json, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY module_serial ORDER BY ts DESC) AS rn FROM shopfloor_event WHERE topic LIKE N'fts/%/state' AND module_serial IS NOT NULL) x WHERE rn = 1 ORDER BY serial"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Sensor alerts (THRESHOLD, window)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "mssql", "uid": "POSFMSQL001" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 19 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 10 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A",
          "rawSql": "SELECT CAST(COUNT(*) AS FLOAT) AS threshold_alerts FROM env_sensor_snapshot WHERE reason = N'THRESHOLD' AND $__timeFilter(ts)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Latest sensor alerts",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": { "type": "mssql", "uid": "POSFMSQL001" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 18, "x": 6, "y": 19 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A",
          "rawSql": "SELECT TOP 8 ts, station_id, sensor_type, metric_name, value_numeric, reason FROM env_sensor_snapshot WHERE reason = N'THRESHOLD' AND $__timeFilter(ts) ORDER BY ts DESC"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Demo story / deep links",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## OSF Edge — demo path\n\n1. **Factory alive?** Stats above (events · orders · NFCs · FTS battery)\n2. **What is produced?** Orders by color\n3. **Where is the workpiece?** → [Workpiece Trace](/d/osf-workpiece-trace/workpiece-trace)\n4. **Environment & AGV?** Sensor alerts · [Sensors](/d/osf-sensor-snapshots/sensor-snapshots) · [FTS / AGV](/d/osf-fts/fts-agv)\n5. **Ingest health?** → [Systemstatus](/d/osf-system-status/systemstatus) (MQTT raw)\n\nAlso: [Orders](/d/osf-orders/orders) · top dashboard links in the header."
      }
    }
  ]
}
